      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think it's a phase though. it feels more like the end of a chapter. like, if the thing that made me *me* is gone, then what's actually left? just a body taking up space and making noise. it feels a bit pointless to keep performing the role of a person when the essence is just... dead.",
